---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Scientific Library"
  description="The PeptiBloom Scientific Library is a public research resource built to make evidence, uncertainty, provenance and unanswered questions inspectable."
>
  <section class="section library-hero">
    <div class="site-frame library-hero__grid">
      <div class="library-hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Scientific Library</p>
        <h1>Research should be easier to inspect than marketing.</h1>
        <p class="page-hero__lead">This library is being built around evidence, transparency and traceability. Scientific entries appear only after they complete the approved review path.</p>
        <div class="hero__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="#publication-state">See the publication standard</a><a class="editorial-link" href="/methodology/">Read the methodology <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <figure class="library-hero__visual">
        <img src="/brand/editorial/visuals/pb-library-dossier-v1.svg" alt="Editorial illustration of scientific books, leaves and a molecular structure" />
        <figcaption><span>PeptiBloom Scientific Library</span><strong>What is known. What is not. Where it comes from.</strong></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--quiet" aria-labelledby="library-principles-title">
    <div class="site-frame">
      <div class="section-heading reading-column"><p class="eyebrow">Library principles</p><h2 id="library-principles-title">Every entry should make four things visible.</h2></div>
      <div class="library-principles-modern">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>Evidence</h3><p>What the available research can support — without extending beyond it.</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>Uncertainty</h3><p>What remains theoretical, disputed, incomplete or unknown.</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h3>Provenance</h3><p>Where information comes from and how a reader can trace it back.</p></article>
        <article><span>04</span><h3>Contradictions</h3><p>Where sources or findings do not align cleanly.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="publication-state" aria-labelledby="current-library-title">
    <div class="site-frame publication-modern">
      <div class="publication-modern__copy"><p class="eyebrow">Current publication state</p><h2 id="current-library-title">No placeholder compounds. No fabricated evidence.</h2><p class="section-lead">PeptiBloom will publish compound-level scientific pages only when an approved Evidence contract and production-ready scientific content are available. Until then, this surface explains the publication standard rather than pretending finished entries already exist.</p></div>
      <aside class="publication-modern__path"><p class="surface-kicker">Publication path</p><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Scientific Inventory</strong><small>Sources and review workflow</small></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Evidence</strong><small>Public contract required</small></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Public Library</strong><small>Production-ready content only</small></div></li></ol><p class="boundary-copy">A gap is better than invented certainty.</p></aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft" aria-labelledby="learn-now-title">
    <div class="site-frame learn-now">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Available now</p><h2 id="learn-now-title">While the monograph library grows, the literacy layer is already useful.</h2><p>Research Basics explains recurring concepts around COAs, HPLC, sterility, cold chain, lyophilization and related technical literacy without pretending those articles are compound monographs.</p></div>
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/research-basics/">Explore Research Basics</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.library-hero__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.88fr) minmax(0,1.12fr);gap:clamp(2rem,6vw,5rem);align-items:center}.library-hero__copy h1{font-size:clamp(3.2rem,6.2vw,6rem);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.04em;max-width:10ch;margin:.4rem 0 1.4rem}.library-hero__visual{margin:0;position:relative}.library-hero__visual img{width:100%;display:block;border-radius:2rem;box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(83,61,93,.14)}.library-hero__visual figcaption{position:absolute;left:1.2rem;right:1.2rem;bottom:1.2rem;padding:1rem 1.15rem;border-radius:1rem;background:rgba(252,250,251,.88);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.75)}.library-hero__visual figcaption span,.library-hero__visual figcaption strong{display:block}.library-hero__visual figcaption span{font:600 .72rem var(--font-system);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--color-lavender-deep)}.library-hero__visual figcaption strong{margin-top:.35rem;font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.25rem}.library-principles-modern{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1rem;margin-top:2rem}.library-principles-modern article{padding:1.4rem;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline);border-radius:1.2rem;background:var(--color-paper);box-shadow:var(--shadow-paper)}.library-principles-modern span{font:600 .75rem var(--font-system);color:var(--color-lavender-deep)}.library-principles-modern h3{margin:.8rem 0 .45rem}.library-principles-modern p{margin:0;color:var(--color-muted-ink)}.publication-modern{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(19rem,.78fr);gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,6rem);align-items:start}.publication-modern__copy h2{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.8rem);line-height:.98;margin:.4rem 0 1rem}.publication-modern__path{padding:2rem;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline);border-radius:1.4rem;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#FCFAFB,#F3EDF7)}.publication-modern__path ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:1rem 0}.publication-modern__path li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.6rem 1fr;gap:.8rem;padding:1rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-hairline)}.publication-modern__path li>span{font:600 .75rem var(--font-system);color:var(--color-lavender-deep)}.publication-modern__path strong,.publication-modern__path small{display:block}.publication-modern__path small{margin-top:.2rem;color:var(--color-muted-ink)}.boundary-copy{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.35rem;color:var(--color-mulberry)}.learn-now{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:2rem;align-items:center}.learn-now h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,3.8rem);line-height:1;margin:.35rem 0}.learn-now p{max-width:60ch;color:var(--color-muted-ink)}@media(max-width:900px){.library-hero__grid,.publication-modern{grid-template-columns:1fr}.library-principles-modern{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.learn-now{grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:start}}@media(max-width:600px){.library-principles-modern{grid-template-columns:1fr}.library-hero__visual figcaption{position:static;margin-top:.75rem}.library-hero__copy h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,15vw,4.7rem)}}
</style>
